{
  "assessment": "The source provides the exact defect supersymmetric Rényi entropy formula for 6d A_(N-1) 1/2-BPS Wilson surfaces with r1=r2=1/2, including explicit expressions for b and d2 in symmetric and antisymmetric representations. The selected cluster is fully supported by lines 101-116 and 140-144, with the r1=r2=1/2 specialization from line 333. The formula is linear in gamma=1/n and valid for gamma>0, N>=3, 2<=k<=N-1 as per the representation constraints. The extraction is complete and case_authoring_ready is true.",
